    'lost_library' => ['A traveler is lost between the library shelves. What will you do?', ['I will guide the traveler to the right shelf.', 'I will scout the next aisle before we move.', 'I will read the old catalog for a useful clue.'], ['The guardian asks you to return the book. Which plan is best?', ['Let us return the book and thank the guardian together.', 'I will protect my friends while we cross the dark hall.', 'Let us read the inscription before opening the final door.']]],
